rule part v1
description "A share of an amount, taken or given back: the amount times the share, rounded down to the yen"

inputs
  share  : rate[step 1%]  range >=-100% <=100%
  amount : money[JPY]     range >=0JPY <=1_000_000JPY

outputs
  part : money[JPY]  round down(1JPY)

result part = amount × share

examples
| share | amount  | -> part  |
| 10%   | 1000JPY | 100JPY   |
| -10%  | 1000JPY | -100JPY  |
| 0%    | 1000JPY | 0JPY     |
